{"id":17411,"name":"Fairfield County","slug":"fairfield-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/fairfield-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:14","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sales","bidProcedure":"Bidding starts at two-thirds of the appraised value","deposit":"$2,500 payable by ACH Debit Transfer or Bank Wire Transfer","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Scheduled Fridays at 11:00 AM"},{"label":"Advertising","value":"Properties are advertised for three weeks in the Lancaster Eagle Gazette Newspaper."},{"label":"Sale Conditions","value":"Properties are sold ‘as is’ with no interior access; thorough external evaluation and research are recommended."}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"CF2E0ZHp4Xju96fqbJAoT\"><iframe title=\"Find Your Dream Property at 90% Discount - Fairfield County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z5RoG-Wohfg?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Snap-Up-Property-Deals-in-Fairfield-County,-Ohio’s-Online-Tax-Deed-Sales\">Snap Up Property Deals in Fairfield County, Ohio’s Online Tax Deed Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Grab great deals at Fairfield County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio&#8217;</mark></a>s online Sheriff’s Tax Deed Sales, where you can buy properties at a fraction of their market value.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With a population of around 159,000 and Lancaster as the county seat, Fairfield County offers real estate opportunities worth exploring.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Bidding on Realauction’s online platform is simple. Register, attend their free webinar training, and start placing smart bids.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Participate\">Fairfield County Tax Deed Sale: Is it Really Online?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Yes! Follow these steps to join the online auction:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register with Realauction</strong>: Visit the <a href=\"https://fairfield.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/index.cfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Fairfield County Auction Site</mark></a> to register and find more details.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Schedule</strong>: The county holds sales on scheduled Fridays at 11:00 AM.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Deposit</strong>: Ensure you have the required $2,500 deposit ready, payable through ACH Debit Transfer or Bank Wire Transfer.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Properties</strong>: Thoroughly review the advertised properties and conduct external evaluations.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Bid Online</strong>: Participate in the online auction and place your bids.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fairfield-County-Ohio-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17418 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Fairfield County Ohio Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Links\">Important Links</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sheriff.fairfield.oh.us/FC-Sheriff-Auction-Sales.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Foreclosure Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://sheriff.fairfield.oh.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.co.fairfield.oh.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://fairfield.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/index.cfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips for Joining Online Tax Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Prepare Early</strong>: Register with Realauction well in advance and attend the webinar training.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Thorough Research</strong>: Since properties sell &#8216;as is&#8217; with no interior access, conduct a thorough external evaluation and research all property details.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Stay Informed</strong>: Regularly check the Lancaster Eagle Gazette Newspaper for property advertisements and updates.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs for Fairfield County Tax Deed sale</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong><br>A: In tax deed sales, if the property owner pays the owed taxes before the sale, the auction removes the property from the list.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I inspect the property before the sale?</strong><br>A: Properties sell &#8216;as is&#8217; with no interior access, so you can only evaluate them externally.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for the auction?</strong><br>A: Registration is done through Realauction. Visit the <a href=\"https://fairfield.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/index.cfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Fairfield County Auction Site</mark></a> for more details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Is there training available for new bidders?</strong><br>A: Yes, Realauction provides webinar training for new bidders. Contact Realauction Customer Service at 877-361-7325 or email at <a href=\"mailto:customerservice@realauction.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">customerservice@realauction.com</mark></a> for more information.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more detailed information, visit the <a href=\"https://sheriff.fairfield.oh.us/FC-Sheriff-Auction-Sales.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Fairfield County Sheriff&#8217;s Office Auction Page</mark></a> and the <a href=\"https://fairfield.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/index.cfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Fairfield County Auction Site</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?<a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/warren-county/#Need-a-Hand?\"></a></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re looking for assistance or more detailed guidance on tax lien investing, feel free to <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">reach out for a consultation</mark></a> or use the provided <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">FREE resources</mark></a> to get started.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">S